From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Tue Dec  2 17:59:38 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Tue, 02 Dec 2014 17:59:38 +0000
