Subject: Re: [stan-users] piecewise (constant) functions in ode's
Message-ID: <-E3Af5zUWo0.8qu75MW6rFoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <-E3Af5zUWo0.AOQ7neCBwOQJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
