From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Wed, 10 Dec 2014 17:56:47 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: autodiff for empirical likelihood
Message-ID: <38lpfz6Hjr8.7d2rTXKz2BQJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
