First translate it to a density, then translate it to Stan.
It doesn't make sense as a density in Stan as written because
we don't know what's intended by a statement including LogN[a+1,y+1]
when a+1 and y+1 are outside the bounds declared for LogN.

So that probably means first understanding what BUGS is doing
with your model.  Then it should be straightforward to translate.

- Bob

