According to https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Copula_%28probability_theory%29#Gaussian_copula , the Gaussian copula density function is

Your last line

Z[i] ~ multi_normal_cholesky(zeroes, R_L);

doesn't do the equivalent of that. You have to use increment_log_prob().

Ben

