Date: Wed, 17 Dec 2014 22:32:21 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] Re: dead-flat traceplots: what's going on?
Message-ID: <HMC2EOXNTLQ.i9btJHYbbjwJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <HMC2EOXNTLQ.ZKoql8RvjEIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
