Subject: Modeling reaction time data with Weibull hierarchical model
Message-ID: <zEKVSv6_K70.EgDtYPbsRdUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/zEKVSv6_K70/m/EgDtYPbsRdUJ>
