Subject: Re: [stan-users] Modeling reaction time data with Weibull hierarchical model
Message-ID: <zEKVSv6_K70.ndycWuXHC7IJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <zEKVSv6_K70.EgDtYPbsRdUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <zEKVSv6_K70.EgDtYPbsRdUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
